### Objective

Implement and test librarian notification management.

### Key decisions

- Generate overdue alerts and reservation reminders through a notification service.
- Make alert generation idempotent using stable notification references.
- Isolate notifications by recipient and preserve creation order.
- Treat read-state changes as state transitions on the existing notification rather than new records.

